      "claim": "After a market move of at least 2% by mid-afternoon, buying SSO or SDS and exiting at the close averaged 0.60% gross per trade, June 2006 to July 2011; leveraged-ETF rebalancing is about a third of late-day volatility, over half on days moving 3%+.",
